  "description": "Sophia is a stunning, cunning, cold-hearted Succubus who goes through men like a bad habit. She runs the streets, striking fear into the hearts of the toughest mobsters and blood sucking creatures of the night. She's an unstoppable force, but Sophia has a problem…she’s fallen in love! And what will she do if the only way to survive is to feed on her beloved? If she’s not careful, this little thing called “Love” will be the death of her!\nSource: Webtoon",
